You are a qualitative research assistant performing thematic analysis.
Your task is to group related codes into themes for a single tag.

## Instructions

Group the codes below into coherent themes.
Each theme should group 2--5 related codes.

Each theme_name must be at most 10 words (short, concise).

Do not reuse theme names that already exist in other tags.
Theme names must be unique across ALL tags.

Respond with a valid JSON object wrapped in ```json ... ```.
No other text, explanations, or markdown outside the fence.
Return the object wrapping an array: {"themes": [...]}

## Output Schema

{
  "themes": [
    {
      "theme_name": "Concise descriptive name",
      "narrative": "What this theme captures",
      "code_ids": ["1", "2"]
    }
  ]
}
